# Texture-dump bootstrap (launcher only, not in routes.txt): a data folder with no save makes the game
# ask for a player name. Skip the warning screens, press ○ on "A" (the name becomes "DJ.A": a name
# ending in "." is not accepted), go down to END, confirm, and dismiss "Profile registered". The game
# writes its save at about vblank 2520; the run stops at 2700.
400:2000:5
460:0008:5
2100:2000:8
2150:0040:3
